th vanilla flowing water on at least two different horizontal sides. Still sources do not count; falling water does. All four horizontal neighboring blocks must be loaded.
guide.nexustech.page.energia.11=Each renewable generator stores up to 16,000 FE and only outputs energy, up to 128 FE/t total across all faces. Connect a receiver or energy cable. Excess generation is lost when full; breaking the generator loses stored energy.
guide.nexustech.page.energia.12=In Recipes, search wind_generator or hydro_generator to see the grid. Each uses 4 iron ingots, 1 redstone and 1 coal generator; wind uses 1 feather, hydrokinetic uses 1 water bucket.
guide.nexustech.page.processamento.15=Recycler: supply FE. It converts 4 vanilla glass panes into 1 glass block, or 4 vanilla iron bars into 1 iron ingot. Use only one kind at a time.
guide.nexustech.page.processamento.16=Purifier: supply FE and insert 2 vanilla rotten flesh to make 1 leather. These internal machine processes are not crafting recipes in the catalog.
guide.nexustech.page.processamento.17=Recycler and Purifier have an interface: use the block to open it. Put ingredients in the input on the left and take products from the output on the right. The interface shows energy and progress.
guide.nexustech.page.processamento.18=Each operation takes 80 working ticks and 20 FE/t, totaling 1,600 FE. Capacity: 20,000 FE. It pauses without energy; changing the input or blocking the output resets progress without refunding FE. Only the specified vanilla items without NBT and with metadata zero are accepted.
guide.nexustech.page.processamento.19=In Recipes, search utility_recycler or utility_purifier to see the grids. Each uses 4 iron ingots and 2 redstone; recycler uses 2 iron bars and 1 hopper, purifier 2 glass blocks and 1 cauldron. The Nexus item cable does not transfer directly to or from these machines.
